From: krun-gaming
Subject: [PATCH] virtio-snd: CoreAudio backend for macOS hosts

libkrun's virtio-snd (from vhost-device-sound) only has a PipeWire backend, so
the snd feature did not build on macOS. Add an AudioQueue (AudioToolbox) backend:
playback through an output queue, capture through an input queue (default input
device; macOS asks for microphone access). Pick the backend per OS and make the
pipewire dependency Linux-only.
---
